<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκληψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking out, collecting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68.4
			</span></i>; <i>removing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>farming of taxes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				897.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				123.6
			</span></i>; of any trade <i>enterprise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				38.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>isolation, dissecting out,</i> of an aneurism, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.24.3
			</span></i>; of a varicose vein, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.36.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>taking of extract</i> from a document, Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				185
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				10.11.8.4a
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
